<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for First party data</h2>
<p>First Party Data readiness starts with provable consent records and instant post-checkout suppression across each app running first party data sends. Protect the first party data channel first: post-purchase, refund-window, and support-case promos do more damage than dull first party data copy.</p>
