<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. For first party data, free plans always bind somewhere; identify whether contacts, sends, branching, or support caps your first party data motion first.</p>
